  ---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageBanner from '../../components/PageBanner.astro';
---

<Layout>
      <div class="bg-[var(--bg)]">
          <PageBanner title="Privacy Notice" />

       <div class="container py-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          <div class="text-center mb-12">
             <div class="text-6xl mb-6">&#128268;</div>
             <div class="inline-block bg-[var(--accent)] text-[var(--text-h)] rounded-full px-8 py-4 mb-6">
               <h2 class="font-black uppercase leading-tight">Our store computer<br />is NOT on the internet!</h2>
             </div>
             <p class="text-[var(--text)] text-lg">Which means there is absolutely no way your information can be hacked. Because we didn't plug it in. That's how it works.</p>
           </div>

           <div class="bg-[var(--section-medium)] rounded-[10px] p-8 border border-[var(--border)] mb-12">
             <div class="space-y-4 text-[var(--text)] leading-relaxed">
               <p>First Stop Tool &amp; Equipment Rentals Ltd. has designed this website for the sole benefit of the customer. We ask you to call us personally so that your information cannot be compromised and so that your questions can be answered immediately by a human.</p>
               <p>We DO NOT keep credit card information on file at our store computer either. <strong class="text-[var(--text-h)]">Our store computer is not hooked to the internet.</strong></p>
               <p>Information about you is not collected on our website even though the site is secure. The only information we get from you is when you reserve over the phone and when you come to the store in person.</p>
               <p>After hearing about all the nightmares with credit card fraud with Target and Winners, especially since our own government was hacked, we feel that because our store computers are not hooked up to the internet there is no way your information can be compromised.</p>
               <p>We do not sell any information to any party. We protect your information off line because it is only accessible by staff only when they are dealing with you.</p>
               <p>If you feel that we are not abiding by this policy, you should contact <strong class="text-[var(--text-h)]">Neill</strong> immediately by phone at <a href="tel:6132584152" class="text-[var(--accent)] hover:text-[var(--text-h)] underline">613-258-4152</a>. The owner Neill Earl does not like to give any personal information over the internet and does not expect you to either.</p>
             </div>
           </div>

           <div class="text-center">
             <div class="text-4xl mb-4">&#128187;</div>
             <p class="text-[var(--text)]">The internet can wait. Your data can't.</p>
           </div>
         </div>
      </div>
</Layout>
